alse\">(</mo><mn>1.99</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>30</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>kg</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and Neptune has a mass of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"216\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.02</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>26</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>kg</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> The magnitude of the gravitational force between them is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"217\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.69</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>20</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>N</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> According to Newton's law of universal gravitation, what is the distance between the centers of mass of the Sun and Neptune? Write your answer in scientific notation, rounding to <strong>three significant figures</strong> where appropriate. Assume the Newtonian constant of gravitation is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"218\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-msup><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.67</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>kg</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mtext>s</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container><div class=\"freeResponseLine\">The distance between the Sun and Neptune is\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"219\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">(</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container><div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:40px;\n                                        margin-left:2px;\n                                        margin-right:2px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"211\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"215\">4</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"217\">.</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"219\">5</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"221\">0</span></span></div></div>\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"220\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>×</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n<div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-2\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:40px;\n                                        margin-left:2px;\n                                        margin-right:2px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"213\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"223\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"225\">0</span><span class=\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\" mathquill-command-id=\"227\"><span class=\"mq-sup\" mathquill-block-id=\"229\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"228\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"230\">2</span></span></span></span></div></div><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"221\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">)</mo></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>m</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>Newton's law of universal gravitation states that the gravitational force attracting two objects is proportional to the product of the two masses and inversely proportional to the square of the distance between their centers of mass:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"222\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D439 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.289em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhere</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"223\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D439 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the gravitational force between the objects, measured in Newtons <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"224\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c4E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>N</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"225\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cD7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-msup><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.67</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>kg</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mtext>s</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the Newtonian constant of gravitation,</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"226\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"227\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> are the masses of the objects, measured in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"228\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>kg</mtext><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"229\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the distance between their centers of mass, measured in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"230\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>m</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>First, let's rearrange the formula to make <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"231\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> the subject:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"232\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 7.096em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D439 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0